# humanymous Sentinel route policy (SoT-31 R2). Copy to `routes.conf` and edit.
# One `<path-prefix> <preset>` per line. Longest matching prefix wins.
# Presets:
#   strict    inject + enforce + fail-closed + synchronous re-score (login, checkout, admin)
#   balanced  inject + enforce, fail-open on unknown safe GETs (default for unlisted paths)
#   monitor   score + log, enforce nothing (safe first-rollout stage)
#   off       no injection, no scoring (health checks, static assets)

/login      strict
/checkout   strict
/account    strict
/admin      strict
/api        balanced
/health     off
/assets     off
